{"4701240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Legend of Gandar IV", "steam_appid": 4701240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Legend of Gandar IV takes place one year after the events of The Legend of Gandar III.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feared on all the seas: A merciless band of pirates under the command of the infamous Blackbeard plunders from island to island. Villages are ablaze, smoke darkens the sky, and the screams of the inhabitants echo across the ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Far from the mainland of Gandar lie several islands whose desperate inhabitants now hope for your help. But the journey there is anything but safe… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteriously, you yourself are stranded on an unknown island without clear clues, without a safe way out. Here, you must explore strange landscapes, survive dangerous battles, and solve tricky puzzles. New threats lurk around every corner, and only courage, wit, and unity will guide you through the numerous obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the island's secret and rush to the rescue of its inhabitants, or will your fate also be lost in the pirates' shadow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG Fantasy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Combat System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Setting </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Content </h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Leveling </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Companions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Animation</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p